rifica/corrige o `outputPath`** — o builder `@angular/build:application` (padrão desde Angular 17+) gera a saída em `dist/<projeto>/browser/` por padrão, reservando a raiz para uma eventual build SSR. O Protheus (`FWCallApp`/`AjustaIndex`) espera `index.html` na raiz, então o comando achata a saída em `angular.json`: `outputPath: { base: \"dist/<projeto>\", browser: \"\" }`"],[2744,"**Verificação de build** — compila automaticamente com `ng build` e corrige erros TypeScript/template sem intervenção (`/poui-specialist:build-fix`)"],[2634,"**Verificação de build** — executa `ng build` e corrige erros TypeScript/template"],[343,"**Wave 10 — Template de cabeçalho do menu**"],[318,"**Wave 4 — Campos de data/hora**"],[322,"**Wave 5 — Chips, Árvore e Notificações**"],[326,"**Wave 6 — Busca, Menu Panel e Helper**"],[330,"**Wave 7 — Template directives**"],[335,"**Wave 8 — Serviços**"],[339,"**Wave 9 — Componentes restantes**"],[3621,"**Why `detectChanges()` in `ngAfterViewInit` works:** `detectChanges()` is synchronous and\nruns immediately, forcing a full re-render of the component subtree right after all child\nlifecycle hooks have completed (including `po-page-content`'s own `ngAfterViewInit`).\nWrapping it in `setTimeout` pushes it to the next macro-task, after `po-page-content`'s\nown `setTimeout(opacity=1)` has already queued — ensuring correct ordering."],[3620,"**Why `markForCheck()` in `ngOnInit` is NOT enough:** `markForCheck()` schedules a check\nfor the *next* CD cycle triggered by Angular's zone. In a route-activated component where\nno zone event fires after init (no HTTP call, no timer, no user interaction), that cycle\nnever arrives. The fields are in the DOM but visually blank until a click event."],[3651,"**Why not `markForCheck()`:** `markForCheck()` schedules a future CD pass; if Angular's zone\nnever fires again (no HTTP, no timer after the expand click), the check never runs.\n`detectChanges()` is synchronous and runs immediately."],[3648,"**Why the zone event works:** Clicking anywhere else on the host (breadcrumb, filter, other\nrows) triggers Angular's zone, which schedules a global CD pass that picks up the already-\ntoggled detail flag. This is why the content \"appears on the next click.\""],[60,"**Zip do `.app` continha os arquivos dentro de uma subpasta `dist\\<projeto>\\`, não na raiz**"],[2618,"/connect"],[2637,"/discover"],[2639,"/discover"],[2678,"/docs"],[2704,"/e2e"],[2732,"/generate"],[408,"/generate — gerar um componente PO-UI"],[2761,"/lint"],[2851,"/migrate"],[2896,"/package"],[2620,"/poui-specialist:connect"],[2680,"/poui-specialist:docs"],[2706,"/poui-specialist:e2e"],[2734,"/poui-specialist:generate"],[2763,"/poui-specialist:lint"],[2853,"/poui-specialist:migrate"],[2898,"/poui-specialist:package"],[2918,"/poui-specialist:review"],[3084,"/poui-specialist:test"],[3125,"/poui-specialist:undo"],[2916,"/review"],[3051,"/scaffold"],[3053,"/scaffold"],[3082,"/test"],[409,"/test — gerar spec Karma + Jasmine para um componente"],[3123,"/undo"],[58,"\\[1.0.0] — 2026-05-28"],[56,"\\[1.1.0] — 2026-06-03"],[28,"\\[1.10.0] — 2026-07-01"],[25,"\\[1.11.0] — 2026-07-13"],[22,"\\[1.12.0] — 2026-07-13"],[20,"\\[1.12.1] — 2026-07-13"],[16,"\\[1.13.0] — 2026-07-23"],[14,"\\[1.13.1] — 2026-07-30"],[12,"\\[1.14.0] — 2026-07-30"],[10,"\\[1.15.0] — 2026-07-30"],[8,"\\[1.15.1] — 2026-07-30"],[6,"\\[1.15.2] — 2026-07-30"],[4,"\\[1.15.3] — 2026-07-30"],[54,"\\[1.2.0] — 2026-06-09"],[51,"\\[1.3.0] — 2026-06-11"],[48,"\\[1.4.0] — 2026-06-23"],[45,"\\[1.5.0] — 2026-06-24"],[42,"\\[1.5.1] — 2026-06-25"],[38,"\\[1.6.0] — 2026-06-30"],[35,"\\[1.7.0] — 2026-07-01"],[33,"\\[1.8.0] — 2026-07-01"],[31,"\\[1.9.0] — 2026-07-01"],[1143,"\\[p-combo-option-template] — template de opção personalizado"],[1558,"\\[p-list-view-content-template] — conteúdo customizado por card"],[1559,"\\[p-list-view-detail-template] — detalhe expandível por card"],[1790,"\\[p-menu-header-template]"],[1160,"\\[p-multiselect-option-template] — template de 